sequenceDiagram
  actor payer as Payer
  participant provider as Mobile money
  participant api as Payment API
  participant db as Ledger and enforcement
  participant worker as Outbox and journal workers
  participant field as Field officer
  participant fmis as FMIS
  payer->>api: Open secure link and refresh debt quote
  api-->>payer: Current amount and payment reference
  payer->>provider: Authorise full payment
  provider->>api: Settled callback with HMAC, time and key
  api->>api: Verify authentication and replay controls
  api->>db: Lock obligation, account and work order
  api->>db: Allocate once, clear debt, cancel pending order
  api->>db: Append audit and outbox events in same transaction
  db-->>api: Commit
  api-->>provider: Stored payment result
  worker->>db: Claim committed notification and cancellation events
  worker->>field: Cancel order or request reconnection review
  worker-->>payer: Payment receipt and enforcement status
  worker->>db: Persist balanced batch and immutable payment membership
  worker->>fmis: POST journal with stable batch ID
  alt Accepted and response received
    fmis-->>worker: FMIS reference
  else Accepted but response timed out
    worker->>fmis: Retry same batch or lookup reference
    fmis-->>worker: Same reference, no second journal
  else Permanent failure or attempts exhausted
    worker->>db: FAILED with owner for manual review
  end
  worker->>db: Store reference and compare settlement, ledger and GL totals
